Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:25.89,Default,NTP,0,0,8,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:21.36,Default,NTP,0,0,8,,{\blur3}《跳舞的小人》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.28,0:01:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾尔西 出什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elsie, what's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elsie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.30,0:03:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不打算投资南非证券了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do not propose to invest in South African securities?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.47,0:03:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么什么都知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How on earth do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.19,0:03:39.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 承认吧 你是大吃了一惊吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, confess, you are utterly taken aback.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.65,0:03:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就该让你立字为据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should make you sign a paper to that effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.41,0:03:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.03,0:03:47.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为要不了几分钟 你就会说 这也太简单了点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a few minutes you will say it is all so absurdly simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:49.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可说不出这样的话来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should say nothing of the kind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要知道 我亲爱的华生 作出一连串的推理来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, my dear Watson, it is not really difficult{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实算不上什么难题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to construct a series of inferences, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:57.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些推理环环相扣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}each dependent upon its predecessor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.51,0:03:59.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每一步又都清晰明了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and each simple in itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.47,0:04:02.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后 只要把中间的环节一笔抹去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If after doing so one simply knocks out the central inferences{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只交代给观众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and presents one's audience{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.18,0:04:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的出发点和结论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the starting point and the conclusion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:11.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能看到别人瞠目结舌的样子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one may produce a startling, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:15.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 这也许不过是哗众取宠而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}though possibly a meretricious, effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.61,0:04:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是通过观察你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can tell by an inspection of the groove{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}左手虎口处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between your left forefinger and thumb, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.54,0:04:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得知你不打算把你那一小笔资金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you have decided not to invest your small capital{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}投到金矿中去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the gold fields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可看不出这有什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see no connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.01,0:04:30.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}貌似是没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very likely not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我这就给你看密切的联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can quickly give you a close connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.55,0:04:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简单的线索 串起缺失的环节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here are the missing links in the very simple chain:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你昨晚从俱乐部回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had chalk between your forefinger and thumb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.56,0:04:39.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}左手虎口处粘有白色粉末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you returned from the club last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:44.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你只有打台球时 为了减少球杆阻力 才会抹白粉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You put chalk there when you play billiards, to ease the cue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:46.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而没有瑟斯顿作伴 你不会打台球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never play billiards except with Thurston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}四周之前 你告诉过我 瑟斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Thurston, you told me, four weeks ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:52.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有买卖某南非证券的特权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had an option on some South African security{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下个月就作废\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which expired in a month, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.21,0:04:55.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他很想和你一同经营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and which he desired you to share with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把支票簿锁在我抽屉里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your checkbook is locked in my drawer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:04:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也没问我要钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you have not asked for the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.26,0:05:02.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以说 你不打算对此投资\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you do not propose to invest your money in that manner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也太简单了点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How absurdly simple!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.77,0:05:13.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点不假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.07,0:05:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要跟你解释过 什么问题都变简单了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every problem is absurdly simple when it is explained to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.07,0:05:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你干吗这么高兴？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, why are you so cheerful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.79,0:05:25.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你正在待业 没案子可破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're unemployed, you have no case to solve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.33,0:05:29.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}换在平时 你肯定心情低落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, normally that produces black moods{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凄凄惨惨 以可卡因消愁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the infernal lethargy of the cocaine bottle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:34.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是不懂什么是逻辑思维\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have not used the logical principles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.05,0:05:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亏我整天跟你耳提面命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which I constantly expound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯展目舒眉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sherlock Holmes is cheerful, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是说 夏洛克福尔摩斯大案在手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so, Sherlock Holmes must have a case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.65,0:05:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看你能看出什么门道来 华生老友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See what you can make of that, friend Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:05:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 这不就是小孩的涂鸦吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Holmes, it's a child's drawing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:05:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是这么想的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, is that your idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那还能是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what else should it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位达比郡瑞都岭镇庄园的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that is what a Mr. Hilton Cubitt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔顿丘比特先生也很想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Ridling Thorpe Manor, Darbyshire, is anxious to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个谜是早班邮件送到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That conundrum came by the first post, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他本人坐随后的火车赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he is to follow by the next train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔顿丘比特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilton Cubitt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别费事了 我都查过了 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, I have already looked him up, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的家族在达比郡拥有领地已经有500年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His family has owned land in Darbyshire for over 500 years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.01,0:06:44.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我想 丘比特先生一定有财有势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I presume that Mr. Cubitt is as respectable as he is worthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.73,0:06:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}容光焕发 神朗气清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a fresh face, an open countenance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.23,0:06:52.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还戴着棕色圆顶礼帽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and wearing a brown bowler hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.44,0:06:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别开玩笑了 你怎么可能知道这么详细\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, you cannot possibly know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.78,0:06:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不相信 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:05.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会留在这儿记录案子吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, you will stay and keep a record of the case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赴汤蹈火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.31,0:07:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多谢 哈德逊太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边请 丘比特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, Mr. Cubitt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就是夏洛克福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:24.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔顿丘比特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilton Cubitt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的好友兼同事华生大夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is my friend and colleague, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生大夫 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Watson, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}荣幸之至 请坐吧 丘比特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you do? Do sit down, Mr. Cubitt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:31.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.62,0:07:37.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么结果 先生们 你们觉得这东西是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do you make of it, gentlemen? This thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您研究过了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you had time to study it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可笑的小人排着队跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absurd little figures dancing in a line, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.47,0:07:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子信笔涂抹的结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a childish prank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.93,0:07:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这点小事 你为什么觉得重要？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you attach importance to something so trivial?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.31,0:07:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是我 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.64,0:07:50.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I never should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.56,0:07:53.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实… 是我的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's... it'sit's my wife, you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:07:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管说 丘比特先生 都不是外人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, Mr. Cubitt, you're with friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:08:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这东西吓得她要命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's... it's frightened her almost to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她什么都不说 装作若无其事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She says nothing, tries to appear normal, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.41,0:08:09.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我从没见过谁会这么慌张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've never seen anyone so upset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.01,0:08:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这和原先用白粉笔画在院子长椅上的一模一样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In white chalk on a garden seat, it is a precise copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.93,0:08:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我尽可能画得一模一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's as exact as I could make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:17.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的确以为是马童画的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did think it might be the stable boy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那孩子说没画过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the lad denied it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:21.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我妻子有危险 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's any danger threatening my wife, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.02,0:08:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我倾家荡产也要保护她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd spend my last penny to protect her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘比特先生 您请坐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do sit down, Mr. Cubitt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.37,0:08:31.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抽烟吗 丘比特先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you smoke, Mr. Cubitt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 不 不 我不抽 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, no, no, no, I won't, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.59,0:08:47.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说说您夫人吧 丘比特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us about your wife, Mr. Cubitt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.43,0:08:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我一直都住在达比郡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, uh, I've always lived in Darbyshire, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}靠近马特洛克的瑞都岭镇庄园里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ridling Thorpe Manor, near Matlock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直是个单身汉 要不是三年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a bachelor and thought I'd remain one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.73,0:09:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去了趟伦敦 还以为会一辈子孤家寡人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until three years ago I came down to London on a visit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.45,0:09:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是做梦也没想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a rare thing for me, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.37,0:09:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是打算去看看女王即位五十周年大典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well, I had a mind to see the Queen's Golden Jubilee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.12,0:09:09.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在罗素广场有寄宿处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put up at a boardinghouse in Russell Square, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为帕克 我们的教区牧师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because Parker, he's the vicar of our parish, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.67,0:09:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他待在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was staying there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时在那儿的还有一位年轻的美国姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was also a young American lady staying there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.31,0:09:22.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她姓帕特里克 艾尔西帕特里克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patrick was her name, Elsie Patrick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都没个伴儿 就交上了朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were both alone, and we became friends, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一起结伴同游之类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did the sites and that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.40,0:09:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你出的钱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At your expense?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你难不成以为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you suggesting...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.53,0:09:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 丘比特先生 绝无此意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's not, Mr. Cubitt, not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.49,0:09:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位帕特里克小姐来伦敦 就为看女王大典？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was this Miss Elsie Patrick in London merely for the Jubilee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.63,0:09:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不是 她到伦敦有一阵子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, she'd been here some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.51,0:09:47.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她厌倦了美国 四处游历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'd tired of America, traveled about, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.80,0:09:50.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后在英国落了脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and finally settled in England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.89,0:09:55.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用多说了 等到假期结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, not to make a labor of it, before my holiday was over, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:10:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就成了个恋爱中的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was as much in love as any man ever has been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我喜出望外的是 她…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To my surprise and joy, she...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:06.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她和我两情相悦 我们就结了婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she reciprocated my feelings, and we were married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}善莫大焉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没张扬 就去登了个记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quietly, in ain a Register Office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你准是当我疯了 福尔摩斯先生 没认识两天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I'm mad, Mr. Holmes, taking a wife in such a fashion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心血来潮就把婚结了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}knowing nothing about her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}解释吧 丘比特先生 说重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Explain, Mr. Cubitt, and come to the point!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.68,0:10:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 是的 其实 就在我们结婚那天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, uh, yes, in fact, it was on the very day of our marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那时我觉得一切都好 没有一丝不快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing could have made me unhappy, nothing on that day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.03,0:10:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在想想 还真有些奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now I look back, it was odd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.21,0:10:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾尔西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elsie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些话我得跟你说 希尔顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is something I have to say to you, Hilton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.55,0:10:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可别晚了 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't want to be late, my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直拖到现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've put it off till now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我还是要给你个重新考虑的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I must still give you the chance to change your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:11:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾尔西 有这么严重吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elsie, what in the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我说完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me finish!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:06.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说的字字属实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what I say, I do mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.91,0:11:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you dearly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.70,0:11:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你对我之前的经历一无所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you know nothing of my life before we met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有问啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.21,0:11:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也是我这么爱你的原因之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the things which has made me so fond of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你娶了我 希尔顿 我保证 你娶的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you marry me, Hilton, I promise you marry a woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.84,0:11:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从没有做过任何事会让你感到羞耻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has nothing personally to be ashamed of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你要按我说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you'll have to take my word for it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:34.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远不要过问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and allow me to be silent forever{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们相遇前我的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as to my life before we met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你觉得这太过分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's too much to ask, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.41,0:11:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那还是请您回达比郡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you must go back to your Darbyshire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.91,0:11:48.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}留下我一个人 就当未曾遇见过您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and leave me to the lonely life in which you found me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点不过分 我永远不会让你离开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's little enough to ask, and I shall never let you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.81,0:12:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样 我度过了最幸福的三年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These have been the happiest three years of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.31,0:12:03.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 自何时起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when did the first cloud{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.98,0:12:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开始有愁云蔽日呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cover the sun of this great happiness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.41,0:12:12.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您还真一针见血 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a way of putting things, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.74,0:12:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您也很擅长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you have a way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.49,0:12:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顾左右而言他 丘比特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of prevaricating with your answers, Mr. Cubitt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 是几个月前 确切的说是五月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it was, uh, some months ago, May in fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔顿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.43,0:12:29.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.64,0:12:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这儿 客厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, in the drawing room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看 喜欢吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不错 焕然一新了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, great improvement!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 桑德斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Saunders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:51.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我遇见了邮差 没让他再跑一趟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I met the postman, saved him a journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有账单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's a bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有封你的信 美国邮戳 从芝加哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's one for you, an American stamp, Chicago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.06,0:13:06.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望午饭好了 我饿死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope lunch is ready, I'm ravenous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.93,0:13:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她烧掉了信 拆都没拆？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She burned the letter, unopened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.85,0:13:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 我不知道为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I don't know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:41.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当然不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:45.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美国是她的过去 是你不容打破的誓言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}America is her past, and the subject of a solemn promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 可从那以后 她就一直心神不定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but she's not had an easy hour from that moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是她信得过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only she'd trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:57.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对她是一百个信任 这点你得相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I have every faith in her, you must believe that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:14:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管她的过去怎么样 我肯定那都不是她的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever there was in her past, I'm sure it's no fault of hers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说说跳舞的小人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the dancing men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.10,0:14:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为她已经忘了那封信的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well, I thought she was getting over the letter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.73,0:14:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结果这些小人又跳出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then thesethese drawings appeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过就是孩子随笔乱画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a childish scrawl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.19,0:14:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可什么都每况愈下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it made everything worse than before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.91,0:14:19.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可不能就这么看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I couldn't just leave it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事还不能跟警察说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it wasn't the sort of thing I could take to the police{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.66,0:14:25.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们准会笑话我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for they would have laughed at me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.33,0:14:28.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我来找你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I've come to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:33.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘比特先生 您想过没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think, Mr. Cubitt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:34.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最好的解决办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that your best plan would be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.85,0:14:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是直接问您的夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make a direct appeal to your wife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请她与您分担心中的秘密？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and ask her to share her secret with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.89,0:14:43.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}君子一言 驷马难追 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A promise is a promise, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是艾尔西打算告诉我 她会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Elsie wishes to tell me, then she will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.11,0:14:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可没这个权利去打听隐私\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I have no right to force a confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:55.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 作为丈夫 我也会尽职尽责的 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, I do feel entitled to take my own line, and I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.81,0:15:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我也会全力以赴帮助您的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I will help you with all my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.10,0:15:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您有没有看到附近有什么陌生人出现过？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you seen or heard of any strangers in the neighborhood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 没见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, I haven't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些农户会收些房客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of the farmers take in lodgers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.07,0:15:19.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过最近倒是没怎么听说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've not heard of any lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.57,0:15:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我建议您先回达比郡吧 丘比特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I suggest that you return to Darbyshire, Mr. Cubitt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.53,0:15:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}眼睛放亮些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and keep a sharp lookout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再有新的跳舞小人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And make an exact copy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.41,0:15:28.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定要准确无误地记下给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of any fresh dancing men that may appear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 福尔摩斯先生 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr. Holmes. I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对了 丘比特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and Mr. Cubitt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.59,0:15:37.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让您夫人辗转难侧的那第一封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this letter which started your wife's torment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.93,0:15:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您确信是从美国寄来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are quite certain that it was from the United States?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.10,0:15:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 邮戳是芝加哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, the postmark was Chicago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:16:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再会 不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye! And don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.74,0:16:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她从美国收到信件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's perfectly natural{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.66,0:16:25.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也没什么不正常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she should receive a letter from America, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.07,0:16:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不就是美国来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she's from America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.33,0:16:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 但拆都没拆就烧掉就不正常了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but it is not natural to throw it onto the fire unopened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.63,0:16:38.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么看上去还有点像旗语了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's beginning to look like semaphore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.22,0:16:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你读了我写的密码专论了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have read my monograph on secret ciphers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}翻了翻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.14,0:16:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}读起来太艰深了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found it rather heavy going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用问 这肯定代表着什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It evidently has a meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:53.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这要真是信手画的 那可就是匪夷所思了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it is purely arbitrary, it may be impossible to solve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 只要这有规可循\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, if it is systematic, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.16,0:17:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就能拨开云雾见青天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we should be able to get to the bottom of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们还需要更多的信息 越长越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we need more messages, and preferably long ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.96,0:17:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得希尔顿丘比特可不这么希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I doubt if Hilton Cubitt would agree with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walker, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你见过这东西吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you know anything about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.75,0:18:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一整天没来前面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've not been out in the front all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.92,0:18:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘比特夫人来过这儿吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has Mrs. Cubitt been out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这我也不知道 是吧 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've no way of knowing, have I, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等我抄完 我希望你能把这儿擦干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I've done this, I want you to wash it off, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别跟任何人说 直接来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tell no one about it, and then come to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.64,0:18:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要你帮我送封急信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall have an urgent letter for you to post.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.34,0:18:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾尔西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elsie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.57,0:19:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elsie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.66,0:19:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在干吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正在找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.12,0:19:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想刚才是开门的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I heard the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:48.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你今天出门了吗 出这房子了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you been out today, out of the house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.44,0:20:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔顿 上床去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilton, come to bed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:10.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一觉睡醒什么都会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything will look better in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.41,0:20:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些画也会好？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will the drawings look better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:16.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些跳舞的小人也会好？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will the dancing men look better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.21,0:20:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你干吗为这些涂鸦大惊小怪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do they fuss you so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我大惊小怪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuss me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.51,0:20:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过是玩笑 孩子的恶作剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're just a joke, a bit of mischief!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}月正中天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The moon's high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.49,0:20:44.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在美国 人们说这样的月亮会让人发狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where I come from, they say a moon like that drives you crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.43,0:21:02.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去旅行好吗 希尔顿 离开这儿好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we travel, Hilton, why don't we go away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.04,0:21:22.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱这儿 跟我爱你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this place as much as I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔顿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilton...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.77,0:21:29.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看到什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么 什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing, nothing at all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.27,0:21:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要去 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, dearest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:37.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔顿 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilton, I beg you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.32,0:21:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外面有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's somebody outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilton!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:45.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔顿 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilton, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.25,0:21:47.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会干出伤人的事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll come to harm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:51.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就不担心他会干出伤人的事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or are you afraid he will come to harm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.94,0:22:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这两个一模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These two are identical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.20,0:22:13.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.66,0:22:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把那个擦掉过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I had that one washed off, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.41,0:22:17.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这肯定是后来又画上去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then it must have reappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:20.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你看清楚那家伙就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's a pity you didn't get a closer look at this chap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.67,0:22:22.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是她没拦着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only she hadn't tried to stop me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从来没冲她发过脾气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been angry with her before, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.80,0:22:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可她知道外头那人是谁 这我肯定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but she knew who was out there, of that I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.59,0:22:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她也知道这些小人是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she knows what these figures mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.43,0:22:33.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些是不是只是后来加上去的内容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was this a mere addition to this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.10,0:22:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是说这两个是两条不同的信息？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or did it appear to be entirely separate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.56,0:22:39.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个是画在另一块门板上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was on a separate panel of the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.00,0:22:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我知道我该做什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I know what I'm going to do, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.29,0:22:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我该回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall go home, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.33,0:22:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我的人在树林里守株待兔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sit with half a dozen of my lads in the shrubbery, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.01,0:22:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是再看到这家伙露面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if this fellow calls again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.84,0:22:59.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打他个屁滚尿流 以后再也别来烦我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}give him such a thrashing he'll leave us alone in the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.55,0:23:01.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这倒也是个办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that would be one way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.18,0:23:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘比特先生 这案子有隐情 绝不可草率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Cubitt, this case is too deep for such a simple remedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.98,0:23:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得走了 不然要错过火车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must go now if I'm to catch my train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.15,0:23:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可不会让艾尔西一个人晚上待着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd not leave Elsie alone at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.99,0:23:14.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elsie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.82,0:23:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:18.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走好 丘比特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day, Mr. Cubitt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.70,0:23:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一两天就会去见你了 耐心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will join you in a couple of days, and be patient!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.33,0:23:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 华生大夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good bye, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.62,0:23:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用你送我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll find my own way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.17,0:23:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可看不出来你有同情心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't exactly sympathetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.76,0:23:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是要我同情他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't come to me for sympathy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.16,0:23:51.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很有挑战性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a considerable challenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:23:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安静才能让我更好的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall work better for silence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.67,0:23:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.29,0:24:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我敢说我也能找到些安静的事去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dare say I can find something quiet to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.47,0:24:43.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.56,0:24:44.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在哪儿找到的这个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you find this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.61,0:24:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在院子里长椅边上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down by the garden bench.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.94,0:24:47.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是不是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will that, uh, mean{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.86,0:24:52.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要让我再送一封信去伦敦了 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll be wanting me to take another letter for London, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.87,0:24:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.12,0:24:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要赶最后一班车 我得马上动身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have to get a move on if I'm gonna catch the last post.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.33,0:25:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克 让你做什么你再做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walker, just do what you're told!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.02,0:25:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事 华生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.27,0:25:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你可能会想看泰晤士报 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I thought you might like the Times, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.61,0:25:20.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为我进展如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you make of my progress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.36,0:25:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也没弄出个所以然来 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it still doesn't mean very much, does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.53,0:25:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多的足够让我给美国发个电报了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite enough for me to send a telegram to the United States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.08,0:25:31.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"ABESLANE" 这是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What on earth does that mean, "ABESLANE"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.33,0:25:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 想想 要是这是E\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, if this is E, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.26,0:25:38.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}手拿旗子表示单词结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}flag denotes the end of words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.95,0:26:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这松鸡太好吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm, this grouse is superb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.50,0:26:41.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德逊太太可是超常发挥了这回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Hudson has really surpassed herself this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.63,0:26:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最晚一班去马特洛克的火车是几点？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time is the last train to Matlock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.85,0:26:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕我们错过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid we've missed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.48,0:26:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我真希望你能吃上一口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, I do wish you would try and eat a bite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.24,0:26:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只需要美国方面给我个回信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need an answer to my telegram from America, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.83,0:27:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来龙去脉就搞清楚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the story is complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.96,0:28:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亚伯 我想留下 我要留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abe, I wanna stay, and I'm going to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.58,0:28:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你在芝加哥的朋友怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about your friends in Chicago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.30,0:28:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的家人怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about your family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.26,0:28:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你管他们叫朋友？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends do you call them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.97,0:28:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一帮子凶手 劫匪 勒索犯 那算什么家？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killers, robbers, extortionists, some family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.06,0:28:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可咱们两个订婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you and I were engaged!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.31,0:28:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 亚伯 那是父亲强迫我答应的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Abe, my father forced me into it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.98,0:29:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟你过那种生活 要我怎么能开心？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could I be happy with you in that life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.74,0:29:09.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你离开吧 求你了 我求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please go away, please, I beg you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.37,0:29:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你求我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You beg me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.21,0:29:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.13,0:29:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔顿这么好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilton is such a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.30,0:29:18.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是让他卷入丑闻 我会心碎的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would break my heart if scandal ever touched him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.05,0:29:21.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's money, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.06,0:29:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都在这儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's all that I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.32,0:29:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.20,0:29:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要跟我回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're coming home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.87,0:29:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.49,0:29:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得跟我回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're coming home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.04,0:29:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.95,0:29:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.37,0:29:43.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.30,0:29:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.10,0:29:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死的 出什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the devil is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.39,0:29:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的电报有回音了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An answer to your telegram?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.73,0:30:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 是希尔顿丘比特的另一封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's another letter from Hilton Cubitt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.78,0:30:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"艾尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"ELSIE{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.04,0:30:16.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准… 备"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}PRE... PARE."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.69,0:30:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"艾尔西 准备 见上"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ELSIE-RE-ARE-TO-MEET-THY-GO{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.99,0:30:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.11,0:30:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.12,0:30:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}芝加哥警局的威尔逊哈格里夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's from Wilson Hargreave, of the Chicago Police Bureau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.79,0:30:48.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"如您所问"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"In reply to your inquiry, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.84,0:30:51.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"亚伯斯拉内是芝加哥最险恶的人之一"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abe Slaney is one of the most dangerous men in Chicago. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.80,0:30:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come along, come along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.64,0:31:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a cab!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.94,0:31:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去瑞都岭镇庄园 上车吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ridling Thorpe Manor, gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.44,0:31:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}越快越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As fast as you can!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.36,0:31:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.82,0:31:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打赌你是伦敦来的法医 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bet you're the surgeon from London, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.49,0:31:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 你干吗…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg your pardon, what makes you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.83,0:31:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她还没死 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not dead yet, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.33,0:31:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也许能救她 不过她还是要上绞架的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may be able to save her, but she's for the gallows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.17,0:31:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绞架？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gallows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.67,0:31:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 先生 她杀了自己的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, sir, she murdered her husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.97,0:32:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想 来的是警长和医生吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspector of Police, and Doctor of Medicine, I perceive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.89,0:32:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确如此 我是达比郡警署的探长马丁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, indeed, Inspector Martin, Darbyshire Constabulary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.64,0:32:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是医生卡休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am Dr. Carthew, the surgeon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.52,0:32:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 这边请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.57,0:32:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位是夏洛克福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Mr. Sherlock Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.40,0:32:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是他的朋友兼同事华生大夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I am his friend and colleague, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.79,0:32:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 这事你又知道些什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, but what do you know of this business?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.08,0:32:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A good deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.42,0:32:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔顿丘比特先生 曾是我的客户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Hilton Cubitt was my client.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.43,0:32:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可这案子今天凌晨三点才发生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the crime was only committed at 3:00 o'clock this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.68,0:32:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在伦敦是怎么听到风声的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you hear of it in London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.93,0:32:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我前脚进 你后脚就到了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get to the spot as soon as I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.48,0:32:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我预料到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I anticipated it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.98,0:32:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们原打算来阻止这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We came in hope of preventing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.78,0:32:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你一定是拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you must have important evidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.03,0:32:45.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道的证据了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of which I am ignorant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.65,0:32:47.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有跳舞的小人为证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the evidence of the dancing men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.12,0:32:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跳舞的小人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dancing men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.78,0:32:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我稍后会跟你解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will explain all that to you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.58,0:32:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然我们已经无法阻止悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since we are too late to prevent this tragedy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.84,0:33:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定要保证正义得到伸张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am anxious to insure that justice is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.13,0:33:02.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您愿意协助我调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you associate me in your investigation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.13,0:33:04.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是更乐意让我独自行动？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or will you prefer that I should act independently?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.64,0:33:08.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很荣幸能和您协同办案 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should be proud for us to work together, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.06,0:33:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但丑话说在前面 看起来没什么东西好调查的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I must warn you, there seems very little to investigate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.31,0:33:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔顿丘比特先生心脏中弹 已经死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Hilton Cubitt has been shot through the heart and he's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.28,0:33:22.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那丘比特夫人呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Mrs. Cubitt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.75,0:33:25.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.33,0:33:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}子弹穿过头顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bullet passed through the front of her brain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.17,0:33:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至今昏迷不醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she's still unconscious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.80,0:33:32.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.55,0:33:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只发现了一把枪 就在两个人中间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one gun has been found, lying on the floor between them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.68,0:33:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}共开了两枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two bullets have been fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.85,0:33:40.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 我冒昧地说句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With respect, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.02,0:33:43.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看上去一目了然 丘比特太太杀了她丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it seems quite clear that Mrs. Cubitt murdered her husband{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.86,0:33:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后又掉转了枪口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then turned the gun upon herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.36,0:33:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可他们是这么相亲相爱的一对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they were a most devoted couple!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.86,0:33:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谋杀现场在这边的屋子 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The murder room is through here, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.12,0:33:57.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用 我想先问问这里的佣人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I would like to start by interviewing the servants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.12,0:33:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我请您 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I beg you, nothing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.04,0:34:01.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千万不要移动任何东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}absolutely nothing is to be moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.51,0:34:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}厨房是从这儿走吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this the way to the kitchen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.19,0:34:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得说这案子肯定是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should think it must have happened about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.27,0:34:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上三点发生的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3:00 o'clock in the morning, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.40,0:34:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们的房间在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are your rooms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.07,0:34:21.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顶楼 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On top, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.86,0:34:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The attics!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.07,0:34:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被那声可怕的"砰"惊醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was awoke by this terrible bang, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.45,0:34:28.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只能用爆炸来形容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an explosion is the only word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.46,0:34:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约过了一分钟…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And about a minute later...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.75,0:34:30.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还没到一分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was less than a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.42,0:34:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又传来"砰"的一声 不过没那么响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there was another bang, only not so loud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.13,0:34:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们做什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.80,0:34:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们下楼了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We came downstairs, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.55,0:34:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以为丘比特先生也会起身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}expecting to find Mr. Cubitt up and about, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.64,0:34:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}追逐窃贼或是发现哪儿着了火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}chasing burglars or the house on fire, or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.64,0:34:44.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是卧室门开着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the bedroom door was open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.73,0:34:48.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们看看了 发现屋子空着 就下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We looked in but the bed was empty so we came on down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.32,0:34:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到处是烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was smoke, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.19,0:34:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}越往下气味越重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the smell was worse down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.11,0:34:53.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}气味？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.32,0:34:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 你是说枪的硝烟味？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, you mean of the gunpowder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.28,0:34:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想就是 先生 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose it was, sir, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.37,0:35:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚才你说越往下气味越重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you say the smell was worse downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.16,0:35:02.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在楼上也能闻到硝烟的味儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you also smell gunpowder upstairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.46,0:35:04.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.34,0:35:05.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我提醒您 探长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I commend that fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.17,0:35:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}需要十分留意这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}very carefully to your attention, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.01,0:35:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. King, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.18,0:35:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您愿意坐下来谈吗 金太太？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you like to sit down, Mrs. King?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.19,0:35:24.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 您到书房的时候 书房的门是开着的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, was the library door open when you reached it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.82,0:35:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开着的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open, yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.99,0:35:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们能看到桌上还亮着蜡烛 就走进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could see the candle alight on the table and so we came in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.83,0:35:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接着 哦 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, oh dear, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.84,0:35:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是我见过最可怕 也最怕见到的一幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as terrible a thing as ever I saw or ever fear to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.22,0:35:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她受了重伤 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was terrible wounded, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.01,0:35:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不停地呻吟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was moaning and groaning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.18,0:35:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后就瘫倒在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then she sort of collapsed on the floor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.02,0:35:49.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后就再也没能开口说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she hasn't said anything since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.15,0:35:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}桑德斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saunders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.61,0:35:54.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们把她抬到了卧室 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We moved her to her bedroom, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.61,0:35:57.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后让福瑞德沃克去叫了医生和警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sent Fred Walker for the doctor and the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.03,0:36:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有发现破门而入的痕迹 或是潜入的人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there was no sign of a break-in, or of an intruder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.62,0:36:05.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.75,0:36:07.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的门和窗都是锁上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all the doors and windows was locked, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.55,0:36:10.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就跟我们去就寝时一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as we had left them when we went to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.22,0:36:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}探长…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspector...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.68,0:36:17.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.06,0:36:21.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了可怜的丘比特夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apart from poor Mrs. Cubitt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.06,0:36:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们没有动过其他东西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing else has been moved?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.90,0:36:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.82,0:36:28.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 我们什么都没碰 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we've touched nothing, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.70,0:36:31.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你们 那么我们继续吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Then I think we can proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.21,0:36:41.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几乎是顷刻毙命 可以这么假定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost instantaneous death, presumably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.09,0:36:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直穿心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm, straight through the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.68,0:36:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}子弹还在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bullet's still there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.10,0:36:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那颗伤了丘比特夫人的子弹呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the bullet that wounded Mrs. Cubitt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.52,0:36:55.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也还在她体内呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's still in her, as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.77,0:36:59.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得找个比我灵活的人才能取出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will take hands more nimble than mine to move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.74,0:37:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是丘比特夫人的手提袋吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this Mrs. Cubitt's handbag?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.20,0:37:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it is, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.08,0:37:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少有20张50磅的钞票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least twenty 50-pound notes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.96,0:37:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用钱打发不走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a bribe that failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.72,0:37:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来 开了两枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, two bullets fired, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.31,0:37:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一死一伤 您所言不虚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two wounds inflicted, as you said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.23,0:37:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 大夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.44,0:37:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么你打算如何解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then how do you account for the bullet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.77,0:37:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这颗明显击中了窗框的子弹？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that has so obviously struck the window frame?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.66,0:37:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真想不到 你是怎么看到的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By George, however did you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.45,0:37:39.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我来找了 卡休医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because, Dr. Carthew, I looked for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.17,0:37:42.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太厉害了 那子弹 怎么会 还在里头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful, why, the bullet's still there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.59,0:37:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么说一共是开了三枪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So a third shot must have been fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.55,0:37:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是说 当时还有第三个人在场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means that a third person must have been present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.80,0:37:50.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点不假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.01,0:37:52.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们昨晚进到这间屋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you came into this room last night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.60,0:37:56.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到房门稍开 窗户也是开着的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you say that the door was ajar; was not that window also open?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.86,0:37:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 先生 我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.61,0:37:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.74,0:38:01.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是关着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was shut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.57,0:38:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}桑德斯 你们跟厨师去书房等着好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saunders, will you and Cook wait in the library, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.07,0:38:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有你 沃克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you, Walker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.41,0:38:13.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡休医生 你可以把尸体移走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Carthew, you may remove the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.14,0:38:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来是丘比特夫人自己关的窗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Mrs. Cubitt herself who shut that window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.27,0:38:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是桑德斯跟厨师在楼上就闻到了硝烟味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Saunders and the Cook smelled smoke and gunpowder upstairs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.40,0:38:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那肯定这儿的风不小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then there must have been a strong through draft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.24,0:38:37.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然的话 不会这么快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise, it would not have spread so quickly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.04,0:38:39.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就传到楼上去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}through the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.29,0:38:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们知道那扇门是开着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know that door was open, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.87,0:38:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么那扇窗户 一定也是开着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that window, too, must also have been open, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.92,0:38:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过只开了一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but only for a short time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.80,0:38:49.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么说只开了一会儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why only for a short time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.92,0:38:52.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为烛火还没融化边缘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the candles have not gutted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.01,0:38:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然会流下烛泪来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no trail of wax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.68,0:38:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精彩 精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful, wonderful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.48,0:39:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是丘比特先生生前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the late Mr. Hilton Cubitt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.07,0:39:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开的那枪 射中了窗框\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fired the bullet which pierced the window frame, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.95,0:39:10.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那他一定是冲着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he must have been aiming at{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.87,0:39:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要么站在屋内的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}someone who was standing either inside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.21,0:39:16.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要么就是个在窗外的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or just outside the window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.05,0:39:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 探长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank you, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.55,0:39:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是说 让丘比特先生送命的那颗子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means that the bullet which killed Mr. Cubitt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.84,0:39:21.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有可能是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could have been fired by...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.09,0:39:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}探长 我们真是英雄所见略同啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspector, your thoughts and mine agree entirely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.50,0:39:50.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是那颗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the cartridge case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.34,0:39:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀了希尔顿丘比特先生的子弹上的弹壳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the bullet which killed Mr. Hilton Cubitt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.52,0:40:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.90,0:40:09.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是共开了三枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if three shots were fired, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.49,0:40:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么金太太跟桑德斯只听到了两声枪响？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why did Mrs. King and Saunders only hear two shots?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.58,0:40:18.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们说了实情 可惜没意识到这是谎话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were telling the truth, but lied without realizing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.71,0:40:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可有点听不明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure that I follow you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.84,0:40:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还记得金太太说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember what Mrs. King said, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.59,0:40:31.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"我被一声巨响惊醒了 只能用"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I was awoken by this terrible bang, an explosion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.48,0:40:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"爆炸来形容"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is the only word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.31,0:40:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"过了一分钟"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then a minute later{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.35,0:40:37.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"又听到了一次较低的声响"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there was another bang but not so loud. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.57,0:40:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一次巨响其实是几乎同时射出的两枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first bang was two shots, fired almost simultaneously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.33,0:40:46.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一枪从窗外射进来 杀了希尔顿丘比特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One from the window, which killed Hilton Cubitt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.91,0:40:48.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一枪是希尔顿丘比特打的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and one from Hilton Cubitt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.33,0:40:51.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}射偏打中了窗框\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which missed and went into the window frame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.09,0:40:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那第三枪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the third shot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.05,0:41:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哀莫过于此 丘比特夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The saddest of all, Mrs. Cubitt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.93,0:41:06.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝望之下 欲饮弹自尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}self-administered in her despair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.02,0:41:15.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们谁知道这附近有一家旅馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, do any of you know of an inn in the neighborhood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.62,0:41:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫艾尔里奇？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}called Elrige's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.79,0:41:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个农场主姓这个姓 离这儿几英里远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a farmer of that name, lives some miles off, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.71,0:41:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}往… 马尔布鲁克方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the direction of, uh, Milbrook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.97,0:41:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偏僻的农场？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it a lonely farm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.68,0:41:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常偏 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very lonely, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.81,0:41:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那会不会有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it is just possible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.14,0:41:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨晚这儿发生的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the news of what happened here last night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.73,0:41:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还没传到那儿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has not reached them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.40,0:41:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说不定 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe not, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.27,0:41:41.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.03,0:41:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walker, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.86,0:41:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想让你把这个便条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to take this note{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.16,0:41:50.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}交给艾尔里奇农场的亚伯斯拉内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to a Mr. Abe Slaney of Elrige's Farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.16,0:41:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别说是我写的便条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not say that the note is from me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.79,0:41:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不要提到昨晚这儿发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and make no mention of what happened here last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.96,0:41:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明白了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.17,0:41:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.67,0:42:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 沃克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Walker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.68,0:42:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我预料会有人被我的便条邀来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am expecting a visitor in answer to my note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.98,0:42:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}桑德斯 他会来见丘比特夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Saunders, he will ask for Mrs. Cubitt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.24,0:42:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要你带他到这儿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to show him into this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.28,0:42:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还要这房子看上去一切正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want this house to look quite normal, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.00,0:42:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对所发生之事务必只字不提\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you must not give anything away of what has happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.46,0:42:27.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.71,0:42:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 我建议你们还是各司其职去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I suggest you return to your duties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.92,0:42:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而卡休医生 我建议您去照看您的病人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, Dr. Carthew, I suggest you return to your patient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.72,0:42:39.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对了 金太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Mrs. King, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.94,0:42:44.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的女主人是无辜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your mistress is quite innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.26,0:43:09.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是怎么解开密码的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how did you break the code?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.85,0:43:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.10,0:43:16.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切密文的破解之路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the rules which guide us in deciphering all secret writing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.74,0:43:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都在于字母E\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}depend on the fact that E, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.49,0:43:24.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}E是英语中最常见的字母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}E is the most common letter in the English language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.37,0:43:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 可想而知 我们真走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you see, we were very fortunate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.96,0:43:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为丘比特夫人名叫艾尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Mrs. Cubitt's name was Elsie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.46,0:43:31.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在第二张字条里颇为明显\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that it featured in the second message, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.13,0:43:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样不光破解了字母E 还破解了L S跟I\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which gave us not only the E, but the L, the S and the I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.72,0:43:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而接下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, next, it seemed likely to us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.18,0:43:43.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两张字条像是提到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that two of the messages were appeals of some sort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.56,0:43:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘比特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to Mrs. Cubitt...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.50,0:44:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加上T和G 字条写的就是:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by adding the T and the G, the message reads:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.46,0:44:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"在艾尔里奇 过来 艾尔西"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"AT ELRIGE'S, COME ELSIE."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.68,0:44:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是这个亚伯斯拉内就是凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if this Abe Slaney is indeed the murderer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.06,0:44:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得立即行动逮捕他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we must make an immediate move to arrest him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.31,0:44:17.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用慌张 探长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm yourself, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.48,0:44:19.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他随时都会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I expect him here at any moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.78,0:44:21.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可斯拉内怎么会来这儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why should Slaney come here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.40,0:44:23.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我写信要他来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I have written and asked him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.53,0:44:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可他不会起疑心吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But won't his suspicions be roused?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.83,0:44:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道他不想逃跑吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will he not try to escape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.20,0:44:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}桑德斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saunders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.29,0:44:32.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打扰了 先生 有位先生往这边来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, sir, there's a gentleman approaching the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.17,0:44:36.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得他带枪了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think he'd be armed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.38,0:44:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}傻子才不带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a fool if he's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.66,0:44:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.08,0:44:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘比特夫人在吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Mrs. Cubitt at home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.71,0:44:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会为您通报 先生 请您进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll inquire, sir, if you'll step inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.51,0:45:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请问您尊姓大名？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What name shall I say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.64,0:45:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就说是个老朋友 她在等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell her it's an old friend. She's expecting me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.40,0:45:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请您在书房稍等片刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'll wait in the library a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.46,0:45:34.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 先生们 看来你们是占到上风了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, gentlemen, it looks like you've got the drop on me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.89,0:45:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过谁能告诉这是怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but what the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.26,0:45:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你就是亚伯斯拉内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abe Slaney, I believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.47,0:45:41.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是有怎么样 你又是哪根葱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I am, and who are you, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.10,0:45:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的名字并不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name would mean nothing to you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.44,0:45:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我想芝加哥警局的威尔逊哈格里夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}though I suspect that of Wilson Hargreave{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.44,0:45:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个名字你该知道吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the Chicago Police Department, will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.32,0:45:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 看来的确知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, I see that it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.58,0:45:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯拉内先生 你该知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Slaney, you should know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.25,0:46:03.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾尔西丘比特伤势正重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Mrs. Elsie Cubitt is very seriously ill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.76,0:46:05.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鬼才信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.88,0:46:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这话骗小孩差不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is some cheap trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.51,0:46:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾尔西丘比特夫人一小时前刚给我写了张字条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Elsie Cubitt wrote me a note just an hour ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.06,0:46:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有我才看得懂的字条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a note that only I can understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.19,0:46:18.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若想人不懂 除非己莫写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What one man can invent, another can discover:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.32,0:46:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"我来了 亚伯斯拉内 在艾尔里奇 来吧艾尔西"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'M HERE, ABE SLANEY. AT ELRIGE'S, COME ELSIE."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.24,0:46:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你最后一张字条是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your last note to her:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.79,0:46:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"艾尔西 准备见上帝吧"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"ELSIE PREPARE TO MEET THY GOD."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.09,0:46:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而这张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.71,0:46:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你写的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wrote that note?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.80,0:46:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说艾尔西受伤是骗我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you were lying about Elsie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.14,0:46:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯拉内 你开枪打死希尔顿丘比特之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slaney, when you shot and killed Hilton Cubitt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.35,0:46:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾尔西丘比特 伤心欲绝 想一死了之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elsie Cubitt, in her despair, attempted to kill herself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.56,0:46:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在还很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and is now at death's door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.86,0:46:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.15,0:46:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我要见她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I gotta see her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.07,0:46:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得见她 我爱她 天地良心 艾尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta see her, I love her, for God's sake, Elsie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.74,0:46:56.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你 艾尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, Elsie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.74,0:46:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾尔西 艾尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elsie, Elsie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.12,0:47:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信她从美国远走高飞就是为了躲开你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe that she fled from America to avoid you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.67,0:47:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你尾随而来 让她经历了丧夫之痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you followed her and made her life a misery, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.21,0:47:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她还不得不面对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she now lies under grave suspicion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.88,0:47:09.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谋杀亲夫的严重嫌疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of murdering the husband she loved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.34,0:47:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少你可以为她洗清罪名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The least you can do is to clear her of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.56,0:47:19.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我目前能做到的就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess the very best case I can make for myself now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.73,0:47:23.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把赤裸裸的真相 告诉你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is to tell you the absolute, naked truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.15,0:47:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有责任警告你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my duty to warn you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.40,0:47:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这会作为对你不利的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it will be used against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.91,0:47:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你也许知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you probably know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.99,0:47:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾尔西的父亲是芝加哥最有势力的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Elsie's father's the most powerful man in Chicago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.41,0:47:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是芝加哥最有势力的犯罪分子之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the most powerful criminal men in Chicago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.17,0:47:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是他发明的跳舞小人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was he who invented the dancing men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.43,0:47:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前我们用来做暗号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We used it as a code in the old days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.76,0:47:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾尔西还是个孩子时 我就认识她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've known Elsie since she was a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.72,0:47:47.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和她订了婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was promised to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.60,0:47:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可能是威胁了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may have threatened her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.77,0:47:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我绝不会碰她一根头发的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I wouldn't have touched a hair on her pretty head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.27,0:47:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过你说的对 她痛恨芝加哥的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're right, she hated the whole Chicago business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.03,0:48:01.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以她就跑到欧洲去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why she ran away to Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.20,0:48:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到她嫁给了这个英国佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was only after her marriage to this Englishman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.21,0:48:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才发现了她的行踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I was able to find out where she was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.54,0:48:10.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我写信给她 可没收到回信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wrote to her, but I got no answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.67,0:48:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她把信烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She burned your letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.14,0:48:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在达比郡这儿过得很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was happy in her new life in Darbyshire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.14,0:48:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来英国是为了带她回家的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came here to England to take her home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.52,0:48:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我给她留了言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sent her notes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.40,0:48:26.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了哄艾尔西回家 我想尽办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did everything I could to coax Elsie away, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.94,0:48:31.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结果丧失了理智 我开始威胁她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then my temper got the better of me and I began to threaten her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.62,0:48:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过昨天她给我写了回信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But yesterday she sent me a letter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.46,0:48:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说等到他丈夫睡去之后 会下楼来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said she would come down when her husband was asleep{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.21,0:48:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在书房尽头的窗户跟我谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and speak to me through the end window{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.67,0:48:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我就这么离开 让她静静地生活就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I would go away afterwards and leave her in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.30,0:48:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道你还不明白吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I make you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.02,0:48:57.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从没像跟他在一起这样快乐过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been so happy as I've been here with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.65,0:48:59.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.16,0:49:06.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亚伯 我想留下 我要留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abe, I wanna stay, and I'm going to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.16,0:49:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你芝加哥的朋友怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about your friends in Chicago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.54,0:49:10.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的家人怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about your family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.54,0:49:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你管他们叫朋友？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends do you call them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.17,0:49:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一帮子凶手 劫匪 勒索犯 那算什么家？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killers, robbers, extortionists, some family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.30,0:49:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可咱们两个订婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you and I were engaged!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.60,0:49:21.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 亚伯 那是父亲强迫我答应的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Abe, my father forced me into it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.39,0:49:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟你过那种生活 要我怎么能开心？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could I be happy with you in that life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.77,0:49:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你离开吧 求你了 我求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please go away, please, I beg you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.53,0:49:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你求我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You beg me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.33,0:49:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.37,0:49:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔顿这么好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilton is such a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.50,0:49:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是让他卷入丑闻 我会心碎的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would break my heart if scandal ever touched him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.42,0:49:46.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's money, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.88,0:49:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都在这儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's all that I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.18,0:49:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, please go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.77,0:49:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.52,0:49:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要跟我回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're coming home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.23,0:49:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.86,0:49:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得跟我回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're coming home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.52,0:49:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.27,0:50:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.33,0:50:08.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.43,0:51:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我们听得够多了 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we've heard enough for the moment, come along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.89,0:51:30.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走之前能让我看看她吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't I see her before I go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.98,0:51:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁也不能去看她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody can see her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.52,0:51:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连我们都没这权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even we have not been given that privilege.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.00,0:51:46.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.00,0:51:49.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望要是我再碰上什么大案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope that if ever again I have an important case, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.09,0:51:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还能交好运 有你帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall have the good fortune to have you by my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.01,0:51:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再会了 十分感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good afternoon, and thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.35,0:52:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.81,0:52:06.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你那字条写的是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you write in that note?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.28,0:52:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看你懂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See if you could read it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.66,0:52:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"立-刻-赶-来"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"COME-HERE-AT-ONCE, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.51,0:52:27.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"立刻赶来"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"COME HERE AT ONCE."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.68,0:52:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也太简单了点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How absurdly simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.48,0:52:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样 跳舞的小人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so the dancing men, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.31,0:52:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在为恶多年后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which had so often been the agents of evil, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.56,0:52:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}终于站到了正义的一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were finally used on the side of justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.65,0:52:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亚伯斯拉内在达比法庭被判死刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abe Slaney was condemned to death at the Darby assizes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.78,0:52:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他被改判为终身监禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but his sentence was changed to penal servitude{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.08,0:52:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为有特殊情形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in consideration of mitigating circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.25,0:52:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是希尔顿丘比特先生先开的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the certainty that Hilton Cubitt had fired the first shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.75,0:52:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丘比特夫人彻底恢复了健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Cubitt made a complete recovery, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.34,0:53:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直住在瑞都岭镇庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lives still at Ridling Thorpe Manor.{\r}
